## Frequently asked questions

**Do you only work with Swansea businesses?**

No. We work with businesses across [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) and the UK, but Swansea is one of our core service areas.

**How much does a website cost?**

One-page WordPress websites start from £199. Larger custom small business websites are quoted based on the number of pages and features required. We offer fixed-price packages with no hidden costs — [get in touch](/contact/) for a free quote.

**Can you help improve my Google rankings?**

Yes. Every website we build is SEO-ready from day one. We also offer dedicated [local SEO for Swansea businesses](/seo-swansea/) for those who want to go further.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope and how quickly we receive content from you.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design — perfect on phones, tablets, and desktops.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

**Do you build ecommerce websites in Swansea?**

Yes — we build custom ecommerce stores using Shopify, WooCommerce, and SureCart. See our [ecommerce web design Swansea](/ecommerce-web-design-swansea/) page for more details.

We also offer web development for Swansea businesses if you need the full build handled alongside your design.

We also offer a [managed starter website for Swansea businesses](/managed-starter-websites-swansea/) — a fully managed package from £20/month inc. VAT with no upfront costs.

